        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features turn-based command battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 allied characters with different effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 4,000 diverse skills! (Including enemy skills)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely customize your character with a wide variety of weapons, armor, and accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the combination, various battles can be realized!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/b78a8821ba0e7ce40ab9c143fa4748d7.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle according to your play style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character's role is displayed, allowing you to see their characteristics at a glance. It's up to you whether you go with your favorite character, find a combination that works well together, or go all-attacker. If you're lucky, you can even defeat a powerful boss in one hit. (The term &quot;boss&quot; is obsolete now...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/de8faab30766aa73d16041b9adedbf58.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your strongest special skills!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters have special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They range from sweeping attacks to supporting allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge SP (Special Points) to unleash special skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-level SP+ skills also exist, and all characters can learn them by leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate everything from enemies to bosses with these incredibly powerful SP+ skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/7c14ab7eca0d52abf0a388a5e69aa66f.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the best treasures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are rare drops from monsters and hidden treasure chests, and almost all monsters drop powerful equipment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase the difficulty level to increase the drop rate, so if you're confident in your skills, be sure to give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/2ca08437709cc35690b0b48927cf2e47.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features turn-based command battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 allied characters with different effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 4,000 diverse skills! (Including enemy skills)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely customize your character with a wide variety of weapons, armor, and accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the combination, various battles can be realized!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/b78a8821ba0e7ce40ab9c143fa4748d7.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle according to your play style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character's role is displayed, allowing you to see their characteristics at a glance. It's up to you whether you go with your favorite character, find a combination that works well together, or go all-attacker. If you're lucky, you can even defeat a powerful boss in one hit. (The term &quot;boss&quot; is obsolete now...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/de8faab30766aa73d16041b9adedbf58.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your strongest special skills!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters have special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They range from sweeping attacks to supporting allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge SP (Special Points) to unleash special skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-level SP+ skills also exist, and all characters can learn them by leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate everything from enemies to bosses with these incredibly powerful SP+ skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/7c14ab7eca0d52abf0a388a5e69aa66f.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the best treasures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are rare drops from monsters and hidden treasure chests, and almost all monsters drop powerful equipment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase the difficulty level to increase the drop rate, so if you're confident in your skills, be sure to give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/2ca08437709cc35690b0b48927cf2e47.avif?t=1785945005\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Game battles are up to the player! As the game progresses, move characters with various skills to overwhelm enemies and bosses. Depending on the combination of characters, there are great synergistic effects (some of which are light loops or even shutouts?!), so finding them is one strategy to win.",
